-## What it does
-
-![Sell decision](screenshots/01-sell-decision.jpg)
-
-The app takes four inputs — crop, village, area, expected harvest — and returns a **verdict with
-reasons a farmer can verify**:
-
-> **SELL 60% NOW** · 90% confidence
